<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:11:25 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:11:25 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>変更履歴</title> <category>changelog</category> <category>meta</category> <description>変更履歴 — このページは merged PR のメタデータから meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py で機械生成されています。手で編集しないでください。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png" type="image/png" length="19713" /> </item> <item> <title>カバレッジ</title> <description>カバレッジ — このページは docs/**/*.md の frontmatter verification フィールドを集計したものです。meta/scripts/gen_coverage.py で自動生成されます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/coverage.png" type="image/png" length="23000" /> </item> <item> <title>サイトマップ</title> <category>meta</category> <category>sitemap</category> <description>サイトマップ — docs/**/*.md を mkdocs nav 順で階層列挙したインデックス（全 1098 ページ）。meta/scripts/gen_sitemap.py で自動生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/sitemap.png" type="image/png" length="22774" /> </item> <item> <title>スナップショット</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;スナップショット&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;リポジトリ全体の状態を 1 ページに集約した自動生成サマリ。個別の詳細は &lt;code&gt;coverage.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;sitemap.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;discrepancies.md&lt;/code&gt; を参照。&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;!!! note &#34;生成元&#34; `python3 meta/scripts/gen_snapsho...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/snapshot.png" type="image/png" length="16430" /> </item> <item> <title>reset-factory（keep-basic / keep-all-config / only-config）</title> <description>reset-factory（keep-basic / keep-all-config / only-config） — SONiC スイッチの 工場出荷状態への復元 を 1 コマンド reset-factory で行えるようにする HLD。設定の corruption からの復旧や、機材の二次利用前のサニタイズに使う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/reset-factory-design/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/reset-factory-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/reset-factory-design.png" type="image/png" length="51258" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD 概念（actor model と vDPU 抽象）</title> <description>HAMgrD の概念。NPU 側 actor model、vDPU 抽象、HA Set / HA Scope の役割、DPU-Driven / Switch-Driven mode の違いを整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="57541" /> </item> <item> <title>gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig 関連</title> <description>gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig 関連 — SONiC の管理プレーンは Management Framework（REST / gNMI / Translib / Transformer）と sonic-gnmi（gNMI Server）を中心に、CONFIG_DB と SONiC YANG / O…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/gnmi-openconfig/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/gnmi-openconfig/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/gnmi-openconfig.png" type="image/png" length="45579" /> </item> <item> <title>開発者向けガイド</title> <description>開発者向けガイド — SONiC に機能追加・拡張を入れたい読者を想定し、HLD・YANG・CONFIG_DB・CLI・daemon / orch・テスト計画の対応関係を整理し、新機能追加時に触る層を順に並べたチェックリストを提供します。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/developer/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/developer/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/developer.png" type="image/png" length="21189" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC Management Framework（REST / gNMI / Translib / Transformer）</title> <description>sonic-mgmt-framework は REST/gNMI/CLI と CONFIG_DB / daemon 間の YANG モデル翻訳層。Translib App Interface、Transformer 各種 callback、Subscribe、CVL の deep-link 付き解説。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-management-framework/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-management-framework/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/sonic-management-framework.png" type="image/png" length="68973" /> </item> <item> <title>用語集 (Glossary)</title> <description>用語集 (Glossary) — SONiC NOS で頻出する固有用語・略語・コンポーネント名・データベース名・デーモン名を、アルファベット順に整理した日本語用語集です。各エントリは「用語 / 略称 / 日本語訳 / 簡潔な説明 / 関連ページ」の形式で記載しています。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png" type="image/png" length="30026" /> </item> <item> <title>minigraph 適用後に reload が完了しない / 起動が固まる</title> <description>`config load_minigraph` 実行後に reload が終わらない / swss が activating のまま固まる際の切り分け runbook。minigraph.xml 構文・hwsku 整合・port_config.ini ずれ・hostcfgd / syncd 起動順を順に確認する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/minigraph-reload-stuck/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/minigraph-reload-stuck/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/minigraph-reload-stuck.png" type="image/png" length="43050" /> </item> <item> <title>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index）</title> <description>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index） — verification: discrepancy-found が付いた全ページを monitor subtype 別に分類した一覧。meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py で生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png" type="image/png" length="41531" /> </item> <item> <title>Switchport モードと VLAN CLI 拡張 — 概念</title> <description>Switchport モード（access / trunk / routed）の意味と状態遷移、複数 VLAN 一括 CLI のスコープを整理する読み物ページ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/switch-port-modes-and-vlan-cli-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/switch-port-modes-and-vlan-cli-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/switch-port-modes-and-vlan-cli-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="37875" /> </item> <item> <title>内部実装</title> <description>設定基盤の内部実装を、起動時の config 生成・Redis インスタンス配置・Multi-ASIC namespace の順で俯瞰する 01 章の hub ページ。first boot / upgrade / Multi-ASIC / 性能問題の原因切り分けに使う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/internals/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/01-overview/internals.png" type="image/png" length="27101" /> </item> <item> <title>Platform / Port / Optics / PHY</title> <description>Platform / Port / Optics / PHY — この章は、SONiC の「物理層に近い面」を 1 つの読み口に束ねる入口です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/14-platform-port-optics/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/14-platform-port-optics/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/14-platform-port-optics/index.png" type="image/png" length="34212" /> </item> <item> <title>内部実装</title> <description>内部実装 — ここでは、port / optics / PHY を「ベンダー実装の境界」から見直します。SONiC core と platform driver の責任分担、Gearbox 接続、sysfs / BMC 経由の管理を 1 枚にして読みます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/14-platform-port-optics/internals/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/14-platform-port-optics/internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/14-platform-port-optics/internals.png" type="image/png" length="25557" /> </item> <item> <title>運用</title> <description>運用 — AAA と管理面ポリシーは「動いている間は気付かれない」種類の機能のため、運用上は事故の予防と回復の手順が中心になります。ここでは password、default credential、reset、フォールバック確認の四つを順に扱います。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/15-security-aaa/operations/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/15-security-aaa/operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/15-security-aaa/operations.png" type="image/png" length="17767" /> </item> <item> <title>NAT / DHCP Relay / Time-DNS Services</title> <description>NAT / DHCP Relay / Time-DNS Services — この章は、SONiC が「edge / management 側で動く付帯サービス」と呼べる機能群、つまり NAT、DHCP relay と DHCP server、NTP / chrony / DNS、そして TWAMP Light や…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/16-nat-dhcp-dns/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/16-nat-dhcp-dns/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/16-nat-dhcp-dns/index.png" type="image/png" length="50078" /> </item> <item> <title>発展トピック</title> <description>発展トピック — この章のメインは NAT / DHCP ですが、付帯する管理系サービスとして time / DNS / TWAMP / terminal server を同じ章でまとめて読みます。OS daemon と CONFIG_DB のテンプレート生成パスを共通言語にすると、各機能が並列に見えてきます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/16-nat-dhcp-dns/advanced/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/16-nat-dhcp-dns/advanced/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/16-nat-dhcp-dns/advanced.png" type="image/png" length="25046" /> </item> <item> <title>リファレンス横断索引</title> <description>リファレンス横断索引 — この章は、docs/reference/ 配下に集めた CLI / CONFIG_DB / YANG の辞書ページと、機能章 (docs/topics/) との間を行き来するための索引である。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/22-reference-index/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:09:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/22-reference-index/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/22-reference-index/index.png" type="image/png" length="23139" /> </item> </channel> </rss>